boot_part_size: 200%

The boot partition will be 200% of its minimum required size
If the boot partition needs at least 100MB for all boot files, it will be created as 200MB (2x the minimum)
Gives extra space for future kernel updates, firmware, etc.

root_part_size: 300%

The root partition will be 300% of its minimum required size
If your root filesystem needs at least 2GB, it will be created as 6GB (3x the minimum)
Provides extra space for system updates, logs, applications, and data

