image-rpios means:

Use Raspberry Pi OS (the official Debian-based OS for Raspberry Pi) as the base
This layer provides the core OS files, kernel, drivers, and basic system setup

image-rpios-lite - Raspberry Pi OS Lite (minimal, no desktop environment)
image-rpios-full - Raspberry Pi OS with full desktop and recommended software
image-ubuntu - Ubuntu for Raspberry Pi (if supported by the tool)
Custom base layers you define

The base layer (image-rpios) provides the foundation OS
Your custom layer (coinos) adds your specific configurations, packages, and customizations on top
The device layer (rpi3) ensures hardware-specific compatibility

